<h1>What is Basketball?</h1>

<p>
Basketball is a team sport played by two teams of five players. The goal is to score points by shooting the ball through the opponent's hoop. A field goal is worth 2 or 3 points, and a free throw is worth 1 point.
</p>

<hr>

<h2>Basic Rules</h2>
<ul>
<li>5 players on each team</li>
<li>4 quarters per game</li>
<li>Players must dribble while moving</li>
<li>Highest score wins</li>
</ul>

